":null,"resolution":"unresolved: facility not located"}],"search_scope":"Searched every STEERS emissions event starting 12/11/2024 in Harris County (0 found; search complete). Also searched reports that started in the 30 days before and were still running (2 open that day; earlier search complete). A report open at that time could not be located, so the search is incomplete.","status":"search_incomplete","incident":null,"matched_facility_id":null,"source_url":"https://www2.tceq.texas.gov/oce/eer/","checks":[{"at":"T+24h","status":"search_incomplete","note":""},{"at":"T+14d","status":"search_incomplete","note":""}],"reported":null},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_1614","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[305.0,308.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On December 11, 2024, the Texas state monitor at HRM-16 Deer Park recorded 20.17 ppb of 1,3-butadiene in the 4:00 a.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.08 ppb. Wind there came from 308 degrees at 9.0 mph. 23 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. No matching report was found in the records checked; the search is incomplete. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility in this corridor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 11 de diciembre de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en HRM-16 Deer Park registró 20.17 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 4:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.08 ppb. El viento venía de 308 grados a 9.0 mph. Hay 23 instalaciones grandes con permiso en el corredor viento arriba. No se encontró un reporte que coincida en los registros revisados; la búsqueda está incompleta. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0069_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87894,"sha256":"2375f9582494c8511986eacd0c1eb65559bd314ab3162542923d26f3713455d9","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:38+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87841,"sha256":"ad09b44f1ba973e847620c1f993365d24266d9be9f7241ceaea5668feb85fa1e","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:59+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0057_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88599,"sha256":"6be3f73caa0dc50df94586cd86d20a4e81fd1d4d7dddc4afda2326ef91a6ea39","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:22+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_1614_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_1614","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","re